  maxDelay: 0
  mailText: "<size=16>Greetings,\r\n\r\nHere is the list of information we require
    you to verify on today\u2019s report forms.\r\n\r\nReminder: employees not fulfilling
    any of these requirements should be given a <b>warning</b>.\r\n\r\nSCHEDULE\r\n\r\n-
    Arrival time is strictly Before <b>9 AM</b>.\r\n- Departure time is either at
    or after <b>4:30 PM</b>.\r\n- No more than <b>1 hour</b> of <b>total break time</b>.\r\n-
    No more than <b>30 minutes</b> of <b>consecutive break time</b>.\r\n\r\nSELF-RATING\r\n\r\n-
    At least <b>1 A\u2019s</b> in any given <b>H.E.A.L.T.H</b>. categories.\r\n-
    No more than <b>3 E's</b> in any given <b>H.E.A.L.T.H.</b> categories.\r\n\r\n<b>[THIS
    IS AN AUTOMATED MESSAGE. PLEASE DO NOT REPLY.]</b>"
